u78i&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot;&gt;4999\n  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;small id=&quot;ihcidj&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;text-lowercase&quot;&gt;Yearly&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;imqgtp&quot;&gt;Unlimate space&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;idzfvf&quot;&gt;unlimate page&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;i0gdwx&quot;&gt;unimate form&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;ihrx8s&quot;&gt;FULLY DYNAMIC WEBSITE&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;izslu2&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; href=&quot;https://wa.me//+919456614612&quot; title=&quot;Inquiry now&quot; class=&quot;btn btn-sm btn-primary&quot;&gt; Inquiry Now&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;idk14k&quot;&gt;WANTS TO GROW YOUR BUSINESS ONLINE?&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iodnqt&quot;&gt;We Grow Your Business Online&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i636mk&quot;&gt;We lift businesses to achieve qualified leads and brand recognition by enhancing their digital presence. We design customized websites with comprehensive search engine optimization, online branding, and content strategy to guarantee business growth !&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iss52&quot; class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i050o&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;img id=&quot;iu3f9i-2&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://abhishekyadav.in.net/public/temp/6/1.png&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; id=&quot;in6gk&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInLeft animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i1nax&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ixm25m&quot; class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;i0we4&quot; class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;Mobile and Web Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;itmyz9&quot;&gt;Are you looking for a stunning website or app that engages your customer? We provide high-quality solutions that are attractive and perform superbly. Our UI/UX guarantees a reliable customer experience that delivers extensively more effective user engagement and conversion rates.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;img draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://abhishekyadav.in.net/public/temp/6/2.png&quot; id=&quot;im68k6&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; id=&quot;i2655&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInRight animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i1hdmq&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iytpgh&quot; class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;in82xl&quot; class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;Mobile and Web Solutions&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iq1s2&quot;&gt;Are you looking for a stunning website or app that engages your customer? We provide high-quality solutions that are attractive and perform superbly. Our UI/UX guarantees a reliable customer experience that delivers extensively more effective user engagement and conversion rates.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ish1yl&quot; class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;inqpgg&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;img draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://abhishekyadav.in.net/public/temp/6/3.png&quot; id=&quot;icqlba&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; id=&quot;isx58i&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInLeft animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iopkp7&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6d95k&quot; class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;ilasp5&quot; class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;Social Media Management &amp;amp; Marketing&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;irx3o7&quot;&gt;Enhance your brand reach and engagement on the hottest social media platforms with our proven social media marketing tactics and solutions. Give your brand access to the ocean like Facebook, Instagram, Linkedin, Twitter, Pinterest, YouTube, and much more for a lasting and reliable brand reputation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;img draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://abhishekyadav.in.net/public/temp/6/4.png&quot; id=&quot;isj4fg&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; id=&quot;ivblxg&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInRight animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;itl435&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6cw94&quot; class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;ikjcbi&quot; class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;Pay Per Click (PPC)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;incuth&quot;&gt;Access the ROI-driven paid search campaigns to pool in more than desired traffic and leads with our affordable PPC services customized to fit your brand. We ensure that your PPC ads align with the dynamic landscape with the right criterion, demographics, and target groups.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;isqz6x&quot; class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i3bvqg&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;img draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://abhishekyadav.in.net/public/temp/6/7.png&quot; id=&quot;i3y1wm&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; id=&quot;ia7hgr&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInLeft animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ibv59l&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iyl1v8&quot; class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;ia6z0z&quot; class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;Online Reputation Management (ORM)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iv370f&quot;&gt;Online reputation management (ORM) is about monitoring and enhancing digital strategies that form or control the public perception of your business. It involves observing and examining what a potential customer feels about your brand, or your product and services when they search online. We&#039;ve collected all distinctive ORM strategies to manage your business&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;img draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://abhishekyadav.in.net/public/temp/6/8.png&quot; id=&quot;i045ri&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; id=&quot;inwpol&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInRight animated&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ibx0fw&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i63dzv&quot; class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;idt766&quot; class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;Conversion Rate Optimization (CRO)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ikjgbg&quot;&gt;Conversion rate optimization (CRO) is the process of optimizing your website or landing page experience based on user experience (who visited our website - trackable on Google Analytics) to help improve the probability of the visitor taking desired actions whatever you want from your user to do.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section id=&quot;divider-2&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6ty7s&quot; class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i2bl8u&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;iyzeg6&quot;&gt;PLANNIG FOR THE FUTURE &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i7sq0d&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;iyq9ku&quot;&gt;Our Track Record Of Success &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ihdk0h&quot;&gt;As a leading internet marketing company with a proven track record of achieving extremely victorious digital results, we are dedicated to providing our clients custom build and completely scalable services &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iwtq79&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.3s&quot; id=&quot;i9ca62&quot; class=&quot;col-md-4 wow fadeInUp templatemo-box animated&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ijq4ag&quot; class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;Informative&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;idnzzh&quot;&gt;Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.3s&quot; id=&quot;izfy5s&quot; class=&quot;col-md-4 wow fadeInUp templatemo-box animated&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;io9dij&quot; class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;ECOMMERCE&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.3s&quot; id=&quot;idlol3&quot; class=&quot;col-md-4 wow fadeInUp templatemo-box animated&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;iccy01&quot; class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;NEWSPORTAL&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iietkc&quot;&gt;Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipisicing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section id=&quot;feature-2&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i9ern5&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; id=&quot;iadnf9&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInUp animated&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://abhishekyadav.in.net/public/temp/6/Untitled-3_copy.JPG&quot; alt=&quot;feature img&quot; id=&quot;ip1can&quot; class=&quot;img-responsive&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-wow-delay=&quot;0.6s&quot; id=&quot;ia9dow&quot; class=&quot;col-md-6 wow fadeInUp animated&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;i31geh&quot; class=&quot;text-uppercase&quot;&gt;Why Choose Ping Media to Digital Marketing?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ievyy8&quot;&gt;We plan, create, and execute effective marketing solutions to our clients with simplified approaches, amplified brand identity, and result-driven value. We have accommodated ourselves far ahead of this curve over the years with all the evolving media landscape. Our team curates the best possibilities personalized to your requirements. We make sure that the brand receives the red carpet treatment and poses it in front of the target audience within the right place in the ideal moment becoming overvalued.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iqvq5g&quot;&gt;We are the most effective digital marketing service in India