(253, 406, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#i31pm{color:black;margin:0px 10px 0px 10px;font-size:15px;}#iaw8z{text-align:center;font-size:18px;}#in9e5{color:#0b5d00;}.row{display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:stretch;flex-wrap:nowrap;padding:10px;}.cell{min-height:75px;flex-grow:1;flex-basis:100%;}#irrl8{text-align:center;}#i1u73{background-repeat:no-repeat;background-position:left top;background-attachment:scroll;background-size:cover;background-image:url(&#039;https://dr.itechgurusolution.com/public/temp/28/1713158718.jpg&#039;);height:400px;}#i53nj{width:20%;height:100%;text-align:center;}#i6q47{text-align:center;}@media (max-width: 992px){#i1u73{height:300px;}}@media (max-width: 768px){.row{flex-wrap:wrap;}}@media (max-width: 480px){#i53nj{width:70%;}#i1u73{height:120px;}}', '&lt;div id=&quot;iggh&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i1u73&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;irrl8&quot; class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;iwhn1&quot; class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i6q47&quot; class=&quot;cell&quot;&gt;&lt;img draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://dr.itechgurusolution.com/public/temp/28/6a0a7ba5-2015-490c-9717-1b8af9c38b89.jpg&quot; id=&quot;i53nj&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iaw8z&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;in9e5&quot;&gt;ABOUT DIRECTOR\n    &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i31pm&quot;&gt;The Founder Director of this social service institute Dr. Ashutosh Daga has a total of 23 years of deep industrial and academic experience. \n    &lt;br/&gt;He worked efficiently as a manager in the field of product management,  market research, goods distribution management and sales in the famous Indian industrial companies like Cipla, Micro Labs, Alembic Ltd.\n    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;He was awarded by Managing Director and Chairman of Ciplab Dr. Y K Hamid during induction closure ceremony in 2001. He trained newly arrived general and special task force executive trainees in the CIPLA company.  He attended many times continuous medical education seminars in various medical domains. He later entered in the field of education in 2007 and worked as Vice Principal, Academic Coordinator in Mewar Girls Institute of Management and Technology, Chittorgarh and accomplished all responsibilities efficiently from time to time. He has organized many national seminars in colleges. \n    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; Many of his highly Acclaimed Research papers have been published in the reputed management journals.\n    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;He is deadly honest, committed, trustworthy, hardworking and a multifaceted personality with many qualities and acumen. \n    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;He have done B SC PCM, M SC MATHS, MIB, MBA, MSW, MJMC, PGD in MKTG &amp;amp; SALES ,M COM, M PHIL Rajasthan University, Ph. D Mohan Lal Sukhadia University, DELF A1, DELF A2, CMS &amp;amp; ED, EMT Indian Rural Medical Association IRMA  degree and diploma . He has proficiency in French language and also goes as a guest teacher to teach students of Hotel Management, Tourism Management of many reputed colleges and universities. He is associated with many colleges and universities as a channel partner.  He completed his school and college studies from Chittorgarh, Ajmer, Udaipur and Jaipur with good marks.\n    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt; He also provides free treatment to many patients. He has worked as a Program Officer in National Service Scheme (NSS) and undertaken development of  adopted villages with help of volunteers while working as an associate professor in Shrinathji Group of Institutions,  worked in the Rajsamand center of Indira Gandhi National Open University (IGNOU) and inspired people from different sections of the society to get education through distance education system and also successfully organized term end examinations. Possessing high level of humanity and philanthropy he have been motivating  12th class  studying students from all streams  in around one thousand schools of  Rajsamand, Udaipur, Chittor, Dungarpur, Banswara districts of Rajasthan so as to help them in adopting best course in best colleges. He explains various career opportunities associated with modern vocational degrees and diplomas to  students and helps in getting admission in the best colleges  with job guarantee. He has arranged jobs for the students of  engineering, Pharmacy, Computer Application, Information Technology, Commerce and Business Management  in well-known companies while working as TPO in shrinathji engineering and management college, nathdwara. He has also worked as Assistant Center Superintendent and Central Superintendent for various degree examinations conducted by Mohan Lal Sukhadia University for many years at SIBM centre. He has been giving career guidance and job placement with full dedication and discipline. He has also delivered lectures on various issues related to all-round development of students under Youth Development Cell Scheme in many colleges of Rajasthan Government. He has  also organized a four-day import export workshop of the Indian Foreign Trade Organization (IIFT). He has also organized seminars for students in collaboration with the Federation of Indian Export Organization FIEO. HE has guided many MBA, BBA students in completing their projects. He has been giving soft skill training to many college students, conducting personality development workshops, imparting interview skills. He is a  life time member of Indian Commerce Organization ICA, Indian Society for Training and Development ISTD, Indian Rural Marketing Association RMAI. He has also worked as Research Associate in world reputed  college IBS HYDERABAD. He is  also a member of Rajasthan Media Action Forum. He has been working continuously for the personality development of students, helping them in choosing the right college and right courses. The basic mantra of his life is to continuously serve humanity with unstoppable speed. He has been working to create multiple skilled hugh manpower capable to participate in making india a world super power.\n  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 28, '1', '2024-04-11 11:33:03', '2024-04-15 05:50:49'),
