t;ip0eap&quot; class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tanvi Helping Group&lt;/b&gt; strength lies in mobilising hundreds of volunteers for citizen led action during times of need. Since 2020, our volunteers have mobilised relief for thousands of people and supported over 20 partner organisations and educational institutions. During the COVID-19 pandemic &lt;b&gt;Tanvi Helping Group&lt;/b&gt; has supported direct financial transfers and groceries for over 1,000 daily wagers and groceries for 500+ children in shelter homes.?&lt;b&gt;Tanvi Helping Group (NGO for Education)?&lt;/b&gt;The goal of Tanvi Helping Group, an NGO for education in India, is to provide quality education for children of disadvantaged communities and make a difference in the lives of those children. A vital part of their initiative is addressing the challenges that prevent these children from obtaining a quality education in their communities.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;section data-id=&quot;6638bf3&quot; data-element_type=&quot;section&quot; class=&quot;elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-6638bf3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default ct-header-fixed-none ct-row-max-none&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;431858c4&quot; data-element_type=&quot;column&quot; class=&quot;elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-431858c4&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;icxcly&quot; class=&quot;elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;160cdc54&quot; data-element_type=&quot;widget&quot; data-widget_type=&quot;image.default&quot; id=&quot;i91r81&quot; class=&quot;elementor-element elementor-element-160cdc54 wow fadeInRight elementor-widget elementor-widget-image&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;it9i4c&quot; class=&quot;elementor-widget-container&quot;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section data-id=&quot;4b3b2339&quot; data-element_type=&quot;section&quot; data-settings=&quot;{&amp;quot;stretch_section&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;section-stretched&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;background_background&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;classic&amp;quot;}&quot; id=&quot;i1nryt&quot; class=&quot;elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-4b3b2339 elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default ct-header-fixed-none ct-row-max-none&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-background-overlay&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;ed81794&quot; data-element_type=&quot;column&quot; class=&quot;elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-ed81794&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;3c14ed29&quot; data-element_type=&quot;column&quot; class=&quot;elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-3c14ed29&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;section data-id=&quot;41b62b34&quot; data-element_type=&quot;section&quot; data-settings=&quot;{&amp;quot;stretch_section&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;section-stretched&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;background_background&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;classic&amp;quot;}&quot; id=&quot;i1gba1&quot; class=&quot;elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-41b62b34 elementor-section-stretched elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default ct-header-fixed-none ct-row-max-none&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-id=&quot;5a7cd766&quot; data-element_type=&quot;column&quot; class=&quot;elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-5a7cd766&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;/main&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div