(259, 423, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#isol{font-size:20px;color:#e10000;font-family:Georgia, serif;margin:0px 10px 0px 10px;}#iobi{color:black;font-family:Georgia, serif;margin:0px 10px 0px 10px;}#iu3f9i{width:100%;}', '&lt;img id=&quot;iu3f9i&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://enwpgo.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/aboutus-aboutme.jpg&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;isol&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;About My CSC Shop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iobi&quot;&gt;At My CSC Shop, we are committed to providing exceptional products and services tailored to meet your needs. With a passion for customer satisfaction, we strive to offer a seamless shopping experience coupled with outstanding support.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Our Mission&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Our mission at My CSC Shop is to be your go-to destination for all your computing, software, and consulting needs. We aim to deliver quality products, expert advice, and reliable services that empower our customers to thrive in the digital age.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;What We Offer&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Computing Solutions:&lt;/b&gt; Explore our range of cutting-edge computers, laptops, and accessories designed to enhance your productivity and enjoyment.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Software Expertise: &lt;/b&gt;Discover a curated selection of software solutions that cater to businesses, students, and individuals alike.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Consulting Services: &lt;/b&gt;Leverage our consultancy services to navigate complex IT challenges and unlock new possibilities for your ventures.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Why Choose Us&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Customer-Centric Approach:&lt;/b&gt; Your satisfaction is our priority. We are committed to providing personalized attention and solutions that align with your unique requirements.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Quality Assurance: &lt;/b&gt;We source products from reputable brands and partners to ensure durability, performance, and reliability.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Expert Guidance: Our knowledgeable team is here to assist you at every step, from product selection to after-sales support.&lt;/p&gt;', 37, '1', '2024-04-17 07:07:47', '2024-04-17 12:53:10'),
