&quot;ih0ss&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;iix7y&quot;&gt;Terms and Conditions\n                    &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;irkeq&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Welcome to Webfire Degitech!&lt;/b&gt; These terms and conditions outline the rules and regulations for the use of our website and services.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;By accessing this website, we assume you accept these terms and conditions. Do not continue to use Webfire Degitech if you do not agree to take all of the terms and conditions stated on this page.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;infmw3&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;io0d9o&quot;&gt;The following terminology applies to these Terms and Conditions:\n                    &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i3jrla&quot;&gt;&quot;Client&quot;, &quot;You&quot; and &quot;Your&quot; refer to you, the person accessing this website and accepting the Company?s terms and conditions.&lt;br/&gt;&quot;The Company&quot;, &quot;Ourselves&quot;, &quot;We&quot;, &quot;Our&quot; and &quot;Us&quot;, refers to Webfire Degitech.&lt;br/&gt;&quot;Party&quot;, &quot;Parties&quot;, or &quot;Us&quot;, refers to both the Client and ourselves, or either the Client or ourselves.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;izn7lz&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;irs8gg&quot;&gt;Services\n                    &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;itgmi8&quot;&gt;Webfire Degitech offers website design, development, and related services.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i4n6ug&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;ip1ldj&quot;&gt;Client Responsibilities\n                    &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;il7ror&quot;&gt;Provide accurate and complete information necessary for the completion of the project.&lt;br/&gt;Promptly respond to communication and requests for feedback during the project timeline.&lt;br/&gt;Provide any necessary materials or content required for the project in a timely manner.&lt;br/&gt;Adhere to payment terms as outlined in the agreement.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;igjj7d&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;iow5d6&quot;&gt;Payment\n                    &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;in4og7&quot;&gt;Payment terms will be outlined in the project proposal or agreement.&lt;br/&gt;Payment is due according to the agreed schedule.&lt;br/&gt;Late payments may result in project delays or additional fees.&lt;br/&gt;All fees are non-refundable once work has commenced.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iftlwt&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;iswvhh&quot;&gt;Intellectual Property\n                    &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;itp1b1&quot;&gt;All intellectual property rights of completed work belong to the client upon full payment.&lt;br/&gt;The client is responsible for ensuring they have the necessary rights to all materials provided to Webfire Degitech for use in the project.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ingh4m&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;iykrt3&quot;&gt;Limitation of Liability\n                    &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i0idrj&quot;&gt;Webfire Degitech will not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages, or any loss of profits or revenues.&lt;br/&gt;We make no warranties or representations about the accuracy or completeness of the content provided on this website.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ihp0rh&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;ip26j8&quot;&gt;Indemnification\n                    &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i80kyz&quot;&gt;You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Webfire Degitech, its contractors, and its licensors, and their respective directors, officers, employees, and agents from and against any and all claims and expenses, including attorneys&#039; fees, arising out of your use of the Website and services.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ibvmi9&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;If there are any questions regarding this privacy policy, you may contact us using the information below:\n                    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Webfire Degitech\n                      &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Address? :? \n                    &lt;/b&gt;Suhag Nagar Firozabad 283203\n                    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Email Id? :? \n                    &lt;/b&gt;Webfire20s@gmail.com\n                    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Contact? :? \n                    &lt;/b&gt;+919456614612,?+919105190096\n                    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ie5ry7&quot;&gt;\n                  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;iw6nvi&quot;&gt;THANK YOU!\n                  &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\n              &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======== Tabs Wrapper End ======== --&gt;&lt;!--======== Tabs Wrapper Start ======== --&gt;&lt;!--======== Tabs Wrapper End ======== --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 24, '1', '2024-04-05 13:27:58', '2024-04-05 13:34:16');
