iv&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--======== Tabs Wrapper Start ======== --&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;igfrz&quot; class=&quot;tabs-wrapper section-space--ptb_100&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;ie4j9&quot; class=&quot;col-lg-12&quot;&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;i3yyj&quot; class=&quot;section-title-wrapper text-center section-space--mb_60 wow move-up animated&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;itn5l&quot; class=&quot;section-title&quot;&gt;Refund Policy Webfire Degitech\n                    &lt;/h3&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ih0ss&quot;&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;iix7y&quot;&gt;Refund Policy\n                    &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;irkeq&quot;&gt;Webfire Degitech refund policy can vary depending on their terms and conditions. However, here&#039;s a general outline of what you might expect to see in such a policy:\n                    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i3jrla&quot;&gt;&lt;ol id=&quot;iad4gi&quot;&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iu70g6&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iusm7l&quot;&gt;Deposit/Down Payment&lt;/span&gt;: Many website design companies require a non-refundable deposit or down payment before starting work on a project. This is to secure the client&#039;s commitment and cover initial expenses.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iy61fh&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;in95xq&quot;&gt;Refundable Portion&lt;/span&gt;: Some companies may have a portion of the payment that is refundable if the client is dissatisfied with the initial concepts or if the project cannot be completed due to unforeseen circumstances.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;it8524&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;iwjd3v&quot;&gt;Timeline for Refunds&lt;/span&gt;: The policy should specify the timeline within which a client can request a refund. This might be within a certain number of days after signing the contract or after receiving initial deliverables.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;iqhypk&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i2pqxj&quot;&gt;Conditions for Refunds&lt;/span&gt;: Refunds may be contingent on certain conditions being met, such as the client providing detailed feedback on why they are dissatisfied, or the company being unable to deliver the agreed-upon services.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ihxcm2&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;ie6nrq&quot;&gt;Non-Refundable Items&lt;/span&gt;: Certain items or services may be explicitly listed as non-refundable, such as domain registration fees, third-party software licenses, or custom graphics created specifically for the client.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i8x2zc&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i5zquj&quot;&gt;Process for Refund Requests&lt;/span&gt;: The policy should outline the procedure for requesting a refund, including who to contact and what information needs to be provided.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i0k3f4&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;i9y04b&quot;&gt;Refund Method&lt;/span&gt;: It should specify how refunds are issued, whether it&#039;s through the original payment method or an alternative method.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;if2vvo&quot;&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;isebij&quot;&gt;Cancellation Fees&lt;/span&gt;: In addition to or instead of refunds, some companies may charge cancellation fees if a project is terminated before completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;i0idrj&quot;&gt;If we decide to change our privacy policy, we will post those changes on this page.\n                    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ibvmi9&quot;&gt;&lt;br/&gt;If there are any questions regarding this privacy policy, you may contact us using the information below:\n                    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Webfire Degitech\n                      &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Address? :? \n                    &lt;/b&gt;Suhag Nagar Firozabad 283203\n                    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Email Id? :? \n                    &lt;/b&gt;Webfire20s@gmail.com\n                    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Contact? :? \n                    &lt;/b&gt;+919456614612,?+919105190096\n                    &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ie5ry7&quot;&gt;\n                  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;b id=&quot;iw6nvi&quot;&gt;THANK YOU!\n                  &lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;\n              &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======== Tabs Wrapper End ======== --&gt;&lt;!--======== Tabs Wrapper Start ======== --&gt;&lt;!--======== Tabs Wrapper End ======== --&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;\n      &lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 24, '1', '2024-04-05 13:39:00', '2024-04-05 13:42:38'),
