(271, 434, '* { box-sizing: border-box; } body {margin: 0;}*{box-sizing:border-box;}body{margin:0;}#iu3f9i{width:100%;}', '&lt;div id=&quot;main-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;site-wrapper-reveal&quot;&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;feature-images-wrapper position-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;swiper-container service-slider__container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview Item Page section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section Start ============--&gt;&lt;!--======== Preview RTL section End ============--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;img id=&quot;iu3f9i&quot; draggable=&quot;true&quot; src=&quot;https://enwpgo.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/aboutus-aboutme.jpg&quot; class=&quot;gjs-selected&quot;/&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-wrap section-space--pt_100 section-space--pb_60&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;container-fluid&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;row align-items-center&quot; id=&quot;ii8zj&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-images text-end&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://img.freepik.com/premium-vector/pest-control-service-with-exterminator-insects-flat-cartoon-background-illustration_2175-5946.jpg&quot; height=&quot;709&quot; width=&quot;811&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;ifm95&quot; class=&quot;img-fluid&quot;/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;col-lg-6&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;layouts-section-text&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ib6n4&quot; class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#086ad8&quot;&gt;About?&lt;/font&gt;BlazonBrite Pest CtrlX System&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;icuwf&quot; class=&quot;text mt-30&quot;&gt;BlazonBrite Pest CtrlX System is the leading and the trusted pest control service provider in Gurugram since 2001. We are completely devoted to remove your all types of pest control related problems. Haryana Pest Control is also focuses on developing industry-leading service operations through the sharing of best practices, new innovations and the use of digital technologies. We are specialised Pest Control Services for Residential &amp;amp; Commercial Sectors. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;sider-title-button-box mt-30&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section Start =======--&gt;&lt;!--======= Layouts section End =======--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  Start =============--&gt;&lt;!--===========  feature-images-wrapper  End =============--&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;footer class=&quot;footer-area-preview&quot;&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;/div&gt;', 39, '1', '2024-04-18 09:23:41', '2024-04-22 11:00:58'),
